      "data": {
        "text": "\"Create rotate_secret_version.py in the current working directory.\nTask: reads a specific secret version or staged value.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b979b116001C9bsdO41ymjKTt",
