      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Secrets Management**\n\nI'm currently focused on how to securely retrieve the API key using Python. I've decided to use AWS Secrets Manager as the external secrets store. My next step will be to concretely integrate AWS Secrets Manager into the `fetch_api_key.py` script.\n\n\n**Implementing the Script**\n\nI've outlined a basic plan for creating `fetch_api_key.py`. I'm going to start by creating the file and writing Python code. I'll use `boto3` to retrieve a secret from AWS Secrets Manager. To do this I will need to specify the region and secret name, which I will use placeholders for, assuming env variables will be used in the future.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789818142819,
          "start": 1789818139878
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
